**Chat scope:** Email processing agent (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

**Reference snapshots (call):**

| Fall # | Date | Notes |
|--------|------|--------|
| **#57114650** | 2026-09-05 | Uwe Kommer — disposition overlay |
