## When to classify (mandatory)

After **any** of these, **before** drafting an email 7-step RE / PR:

1. Typed **RE** / `run.py --once` extract finishes  
2. Armed path: `--await-arm` returns extract / case is open after Anwenden / Weiter / Weiterleiten  
3. User opens a case and asks you to handle it  

### Script detection (authoritative — post-open poll ~4s)

Extract runs **`_detect_case_channel()`** after case open (post-arm). Stdout includes:

| Script output | Meaning | Agent path |
|---------------|---------|------------|
| **`CHANNEL: CALL`** + **`CHANNEL_CALL_DETECTED`** + **`CALL_LF_GATE`** | Anruf timeline / call UI; **no** email body | Voice Auto-LF + Next/weiter/extern — **no** 7-step RE/PR |
| **`CHANNEL: EMAIL`** + **`CUSTOMER EMAIL`** + **`RE_TEXT_ONLY_GATE`** | `html-message-content` email body present | Three-turn 7-step RE |

**First line of agent analysis must echo the script line:** `CHANNEL: CALL` or `CHANNEL: EMAIL`.

If script says **CALL**, do **not** override to EMAIL because of chat bubbles or empty extract. If script says **EMAIL**, proceed with RE.

Manual/visual check (below) only when stdout shows **`CHANNEL: UNKNOWN`**.

| Channel | Next step |
|---------|-----------|
| **EMAIL** | Normal **7-step RE** → **Auto-LF** → **PR** / transfer arm |
| **CALL** | **Do not** run email RE→PR. **Immediately Auto-LF** (`--channel voice`) + arm **Next** (or Weiter/Extern if transfer). BRIEF / handling pack is **optional** coaching — **not** a gate for Auto-LF |
| **UNKNOWN** | Ask user; do not PR |

