## CALL markers (any strong set → CALL)

### A) Live / voice overlays (strongest)

| Marker | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| **Im Gespräch** | In-call status + timer |
| **Mikrofon angeschlossen** | Mic connected |
| **VOIP Nailed Up Leitung: Verbunden** (or similar) | Voice path up |
| **Medienauslagerung fehlgeschlagen** (optional) | Media status on call UI |
| Floating **Case #…** + **o2 Disposition Plan** / **Disposition Codes** | Call disposition overlay |
| Green **phone** icon next to MSISDN on disposition card | Voice contact |

### B) Timeline (strong) — Fall #57937085

| Marker | Example |
|--------|---------|
| **Anruf •** (lock + time under bubbles) | `Anruf • 3min`, `Anruf • 2min` |
| **Eingehender Anruf** | Incoming call + MSISDN (e.g. `+491777295745`) |
| **Anruf angenommen** | Call accepted (green phone bubble) |
| **In Warteschlange übertragen** | Queue transfer (e.g. `WQ_IBV_O2_CARE_I@H`) |
| **Anruf wurde getrennt** | Call disconnected (red phone bubble) |
| **Wartestellung** / **in Wartestellung** | Customer on hold |
| **Blindübertragung abgeschlossen** | Blind transfer complete |
| **Anruf beendet** / **Aufzeichnung** | Call ended / recording |
| Audio bubbles / waveforms | Not email body |
| DOM testids | `audio_pres`, `call-button`, `omniMedia`, `mediaItems`, … |

### B2) Call-only UI chrome (#57937085)

| Marker | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| **Live timer** next to Fall # | e.g. `Fall #57937085` + `00:02:40` |
| **Phone handset** icon in case toolbar (top-right) | Voice case actions |
| **Mic / pause / red hang-up** in left sidebar | Active voice session controls |
| **Sie können auf das Gespräch nicht antworten.** | No email reply composer — **decisive CALL** |
| **No** `html-message-content` email body | Timeline = call events only, not Von/Betreff mail |

### C) Supporting Case Informationen

| Field | Call example (snapshot) |
|-------|-------------------------|
| **Quelle** | `Aura Care Shared` (not Care Webform) |
| **Ziel** | e.g. `Sales Beratung - Mobile Pilot 2` |

### D) Negative email signals

| Signal | On call snapshot |
|--------|------------------|
| `html-message-content` | Often **0** |
| TinyMCE | Often absent during live call |
| `Nachricht verfassen` | May exist in shell — **not** proof of email |

---

## EMAIL markers

Care Webform / mail Quelle, readable **html-message-content** bodies, no Im Gespräch / Disposition / Anruf-audio timeline → **EMAIL** → normal RE/PR/LF.

---

## Detection order

1. **Script stdout** after extract: `CHANNEL: CALL` / `CHANNEL: EMAIL` (DOM poll post-open)  
2. **Im Gespräch** or Disposition overlay → **CALL**  
3. **Anruf angenommen** / **Anruf beendet** / **Anruf •** timeline / **Eingehender Anruf** → **CALL** (no email body)  
4. Substantial **`html-message-content`** + Von/Betreff → **EMAIL**  
5. Else → **UNKNOWN** — ask operator; do not PR
